    "Are you traveling outside your usual area right now (e.g., out of state or abroad)?"
  ],
  "instructions_for_now": [
    "Look at the very top status bar on your phone and tell me exactly what you see: do you see an airplane ✈️ icon, how many signal bars (or does it say “No Service”), and any network label like 5G/4G/3G.",
