messages.content:
{
  "message": "Thanks for the details. I’ve located your line and here’s what I see on our side.",
  "account_findings": {
    "customer_id": "C1001",
    "line_phone_number": "555-123-2002",
    "line_id": "L1002",
    "line_status": "Active",
    "roaming_enabled_on_account": true,
    "plan_data": {
      "plan_name": "Premium Plan",
      "data_limit_gb": 15,
      "used_gb": 8.7,
      "cycle_ends": "2025-02-28"
    },
    "interpretation": "Your account and line are in good standing, roaming is enabled on our side, and you still have data left. That means the MMS issue is likely due to a device-side setting while you’re roaming."
  },
  "my_plan_and_reasoning": "Because you’re abroad, MMS depends on mobile data and the correct MMS (MMSC) settings. We’ll first confirm your phone has mobile data and data roaming turned on, that you’re on at least 3G/4G/5G, and then verify the APN/MMSC and a couple of features (Wi‑Fi Calling, Data Saver/VPN) that can interfere.",
  "steps_for_you": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "title": "Confirm mobile data works over cellular (Wi‑Fi OFF)",
      "why": "MMS requires mobile data even if Wi‑Fi is available.",
      "do": [
        "Turn Wi‑Fi OFF temporarily.",
        "Action: check_network_status — tell me: signal bars, network type (5G/4G/3G/2G), Mobile Data ON/OFF, Data Roaming ON/OFF.",
        "Open a browser and try any website OR run run_speed_test and share the result."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "title": "Ensure Data Roaming is ON (on the phone)",
      "why": "Abroad, mobile data won’t work if the phone’s data roaming toggle is OFF.",
      "do": [
        "If step 1 showed Data Roaming is OFF, turn it ON: toggle_roaming.",
        "Then retry browsing or run run_speed_test again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "title": "Verify network mode isn’t stuck on 2G",
      "why": "2G is not suitable for MMS.",
      "do": [
        "Action: check_network_mode_preference.",
        "If it shows 2G/3G only, set to 4g_5g_preferred: set_network_mode_preference(mode=\"4g_5g_preferred\")."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "title": "Check APN settings for MMSC",
      "why": "A missing/incorrect MMSC URL will prevent MMS sending.",
      "do": [
        "Action: check_apn_settings — tell me the APN name and whether an MMSC URL is listed.",
        "If MMSC is missing/incorrect: reset_apn_settings, then reboot_device.",
        "After reboot, try sending an MMS again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "title": "Temporarily disable Wi‑Fi Calling and retest",
      "why": "In some cases while roaming, Wi‑Fi Calling can interfere with MMS.",
      "do": [
        "Action: check_wifi_calling_status.",
        "If ON, turn it OFF: toggle_wifi_calling, then try sending an MMS."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "title": "Rule out Data Saver or VPN",
      "why": "Both can block or slow data needed for MMS.",
      "do": [
        "Action: check_data_restriction_status — if Data Saver is ON, toggle_data_saver_mode to OFF.",
        "Action: check_vpn_status — if a VPN is connected, disconnect_vpn and retest."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "title": "Confirm the messaging app has needed permissions",
      "why": "It needs storage and SMS permissions to send media.",
      "do": [
        "Action: check_app_permissions(app_name=\"messaging\").",
        "If missing, grant: grant_app_permission(app_name=\"messaging\", permission=\"storage\") and grant_app_permission(app_name=\"messaging\", permission=\"sms\").",
        "Then try sending an MMS (you can send a photo to your own number as a test)."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "what_to_reply_with": {
    "device_readouts": [
      "From check_status_bar or check_network_status: Airplane Mode icon, signal bars, network type, Mobile Data ON/OFF, Data Roaming ON/OFF.",
      "run_speed_test result (if you ran it).",
      "APN name and whether an MMSC URL is present (from check_apn_settings).",
      "Wi‑Fi Calling status.",
      "Whether a VPN or Data Saver was ON.",
      "Result of can_send_mms if you run it."
    ],
    "device_info": "Phone make/model and software version (Android or iPhone).",
    "test_result": "After these steps, did an MMS send successfully?"
  },
  "notes": [
    "If any step changes something, try sending an MMS right after that step and let me know exactly what happens.",
    "I’ve confirmed roaming is enabled on your line already; if your phone still won’t use data while roaming, the device-side Data Roaming toggle is the most likely culprit."
  ]
}

