  "thought_process": "Your account/line are active and roaming is enabled on our side. With strong 5G signal and data ON, the remaining requirement while abroad is the phone’s Data Roaming toggle. Let’s enable that first, confirm data works, and then test MMS. If MMS still fails, we’ll verify APN/MMSC and rule out Wi‑Fi Calling, Data Saver/VPN, and app permissions."
}

