      "what_this_means": "Your phone did not load the carrier defaults automatically.",
      "next_step": "I can connect you with a human agent to provide the exact MMSC/APN values for your device and region.",
      "what_i_need": "Tell me that the MMSC is still missing after the reset and reboot."
    },
