{
  "thought_process": "Your status bar shows signal and 5G (good) but indicates mobile data is disabled. Calls don’t require the Mobile Data switch, but MMS and internet do. We’ll safely test a call to confirm voice service, then turn Mobile Data and Data Roaming ON so MMS can send.",
