      "step": "Allow background data for Messages",
      "how": "Settings > Apps > Messages (your SMS app) > Mobile data & Wi‑Fi > turn ON Background data and Unrestricted data usage.",
      "why": "Ensures the Messages app can use data to send/receive MMS."
